# Measured off art/back.jpg (mishka_chelekom, plate 1, manual from the
# hero, nothing lettered on it), as fractions of its width (728px): the
# sparrow on its bar between 0.59 and 0.82, centred on the width; the
# darker band from 1.236 (0.879 of the height), 0.17 tall. No frame on
# the plate, so the screenshots start near the top of the face, two
# frames at the shots' own proportion (600x520). The band is short for the
# pattern's two rows — the version line and the seal ran off the foot —
# so the strip is one row, the install command beside the name, as on
# dashboard_extras. No quote on this back (copy.md says
# why), so the features and the flash have its room.
FRAMES="0.075,0.07,0.40,0.347 0.525,0.07,0.40,0.347"
FRAME_RULE="#15101F,6,#F2A33A,2"
CAPTION_Y=0.44
HEAD_Y=0.52
PANEL=""
BLURB_Y=0.60
FEAT_Y=0.86
REQ_Y=1.10
NAME_Y=1.275
INSTALL_ROW=beside
NAME_POINT=0.019
NAME_KERN=0.001
INSTALL_POINT=0.014
ERA=cdrom
ACCENT="#F2A33A"
